mapping "W740.1" source="W740" target="217748000" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target quality=100 {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W740 = Swedish extension of W74 SNOMED CT 217748000, place= (bostad och bostadsområde).
        Target SNOMED CT 436593 = sctid 217748000, active RF2 INT. Why this target: Athena crosswalk maps
        W74 (id 45756320) → 436593; the Swedish place= refinement has no standard SNOMED CT analogue (the
        [X]Drowning place-of-occurrence SNOMED CT concepts are pre-coordinated to W66/W67 etc., not to
        W74), so the crosswalk target is the best standard concept and fully subsumes the source. Why :
        crosswalk-verified base, small breadth mismatch on the place axis — high tier. Broader: target
        contains the source.
        """
}
